# OS
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private working material, never committed.
#
# This repository is public and is the source of the robustmargin package on PyPI.
# The agent and tooling setup, the planning and design documents, and the review log
# stay local: they remain on disk and fully usable, and are never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Claude Code setup: agent definitions, skills, hook wiring, scratch
.claude/

# Repository tooling that references the above. The exceptions are committed on
# purpose: the workflows, so GitHub Actions runs them; CODEOWNERS, so GitHub requests
# the code owner's review on every pull request; and the PR template, so GitHub
# pre-fills every PR description.
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
!.github/CODEOWNERS
!.github/pull_request_template.md

# Project instructions for Claude Code
CLAUDE.md

# Planning and design documents, kept private on purpose.
docs/

